\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 The silversmith who sold \uc2 BCV\uc2  to the banks in its 18th  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 349 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Mai 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Meridiano Editorial Staff\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 (BCV) sold 63 million dollars to banks in its eighteenth exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this Monday, May 8, 1 million more than in the previous week in anticipation of greater pressures on the market, due to the possible advance payment of the increase of the cestaticket, to the equivalent in bolivars to 40 dollars.\par \par \uc2 This bet of the issuing entity is to maintain the exchange rate stability, according to the data on the evolution of prices published on Monday, May 8 by the Venezuelan Finance Observatory, and works as a determining factor in the control of inflation.\par \par \uc2 Read also: Oh Dad! This is the amount that pensioned grandparents will be able to collect once registered in the Patria System.\par \par \uc2 The price established for this \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is 27.59 bolivars per euro(EUR), equivalent to 25.06 bolivars per dollar(USD), an increase of 0.99% compared to the quotation of the previous week.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has raised 54.88% the value of the American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  it has placed in the banking system, while the official exchange rate has climbed 43.28%, with very contained variations since mid-February.\par \par \uc2 Read also: Mr. Beast raffles 50 thousand dollars, find out the steps to win them (+DETAILS)\par \par \uc2 In the first two weeks of May, the \uc2 Venezuelan \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange market with 125 million dollars, 18 million less than in the same period of April. An accumulated so far this year and that stands at 1,470 million dollars, a decrease of 12 million dollars or 0.84% compared to the same period of 2022.\par \par \uc2 Now, in this 2023, the average amount per \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is US$59 million, 25.6% lower than the average of US$74 million recorded in the same period of 2022, a situation that is explained by the fact that this year there are fewer extensions and weekly sales were lower in the first month and a half.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230509ej590099y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
