\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Parallel dollar continues to rise, reaching Bs 6.42 and experts predict more inflation\b0\par\par\uc2 555 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 2022\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 As a result of the exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy implemented by the Government to influence the price of the parallel dollar, the country's international reserves have fallen by more than $500 million since December 2021.\par \par \uc2 The relative stability that the exchange rate has maintained during the last year seems to be about to be broken, since in the last quarter there has been again a galloping depreciation of the bolivar against the US dollar, which this Wednesday, August 17, reached the price of Bs 6.42.\par \par \uc2 During the last quarter there was an increase in the parallel exchange rate, which went from being valued at Bs 4.62 to Bs 6.42 per dollar, according to publications of the \uc2 Venezuelan \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This translates into a 28% increase in only three months.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, in the first six months of the year there was no increase. In fact, there was a slight appreciation of the bolivar against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , falling from Bs 4.71 to Bs 4.62 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 This increase of the parallel dollar causes an ever greater disparity against the official exchange rate, since the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Venezuela\uc2  establishes it at Bs 5.97 per dollar. This means that the Monitor D\u243\'00\'F3lar Venezuela marker is 7.5% higher.\par \par \uc2 In other words, to pay a $100 bill, Bs 597 would be needed if the merchant charges at the official rate, but Bs 642 if the parallel rate is applied. That is a difference of Bs 45 between both payments.\par \par \uc2 Economist Jos\u233\'00\'E9 Guerra, founder of the Venezuelan Finance Observatory (OVF) and deputy to the National Assembly in 2015, warns that inflation will continue its course, so it is likely to observe a greater movement of the parallel rate in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 During the last year, Guerra and other economists have warned that the strategy applied by the \uc2 BCV\uc2  to try to contain the exchange rate was unsustainable, since they injected money from international reserves into the exchange market to increase the supply and maintain the price.\par \par \uc2 As a result of this policy, since December 2021 there have been losses of more than $500 million of the international reserves, which have fallen from $5,886 million to $5,330 million (discounting the $5,000 million added by the \uc2 BCV\uc2  that actually correspond to the Special Drawing Rights that the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  has pending to be assigned to \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 "The strategy of the \uc2 BCV\uc2  and the Government to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  (the exchange market) by selling dollars was exhausted due to the sharp fall of the \uc2 BCV\uc2 's international reserves, as seen in the chart. It was only a matter of time", reasoned Guerra.\par \par \uc2 The economist added that a second element adds pressure on the exchange rate. He referred to the fall in oil prices and exports, which translates into less money for Venezuela and therefore a lower capacity to inject dollars into the exchange market. "Inflation is going to increase", he asserted.\par \par \uc2 According to estimates by economists such as Asdr\u250\'00\'FAbal Oliveros, director of the consulting firm Ecoanal\u237\'00\'EDtica, the equilibrium exchange rate -which does not take into account the distortion of supply and demand- is around Bs 22, almost four times the official exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020220818ei8h000md\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
