ber 21, 2021.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020211108ehb8009w7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
