\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 Hyperinflation in Venezuela: So far this year, the price index accumulates 2.674%\b0\par\par\uc2 507 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 September 2019\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 Venezuela is going through hyperinflation as a result of the crisis (Photo by Yuri CORTEZ / AFP)Hyperinflation in Venezuela continued in August its slowdown at a year-on-year pace, stood at 135.379%,according to a report by the opposition majority Parliament presented on Thursday.\u160\'00\'A0However, the price index increased compared to the previous month, at 65.2%, almost twice as muchas July, said Mr Angel Alvarado,a member of the Legislative Finance Committee, at a press conference.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, cumulative inflation 2.674%,the committee detailed.\par \par \uc2 The year-on-year slowdown responds to an "incipient" monetary discipline of the Chavista regime, the decline in public spending and the monetization of the deficit through the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Venezuela\uc2  (BCV), evidenced through July, explained to the Agency AFP the \uc2 Economist\uc2  Asdr\u250\'00\'FAbal Oliveros,of the firm Ecoanal\u237\'00\'EDtica.\par \par \uc2 But although compared to 2018 "the inflation rate is slightly lower", the fundamental problem has not been solved,the specialist said, auguring an upward trend the rest of the year.\par \par \uc2 Dictator Nicol\u225\'00\'E1s Maduro launched a reform program in August that included the elimination of five zeros to the bolivar and a 96% depreciation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar,while promising to end the issuance of money without support, according to analysts , the main fuel for inflation.\par \par \uc2 In the absence of official statistics, the National Assembly publishes inflation rates on a monthly basis (EFE/Rayner Pe\u241\'00\'F1a)Today in Venezuela, immersed in the worst crisis in its recent history, "the minimum wage (...) buys only 2% of the food basket,"Ms Alvarado said.\par \par \uc2 Maduro doubled the minimum wage in April to 40,000 bolivars, which then amounted to about $8 but today is only $2. A carton of 30 eggs, for example, is sold for 70,000 bolivars ($3.5) and one kilo of meat to 50,000 bolivars (2.5).\par \par \uc2 Parliament, the only power controlled by the opposition, has since 2017 disclosed its own inflation rate, in response to a statistical silence of the BCV, which had not given data for three years until it offered it again in May, although it has not remade.\par \par \uc2 The issuing body then reported that inflation in 2018 had reached 130.060% and that the economy has halved since 2013. It still doesn't release 2019 figures.\par \par \uc2 Parliament, whose decisions are considered null and void by justice after finding it "in contempt," calculated last year's inflation at 1,698,488.2%.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) reduced its inflation forecast in 2019 from 10,000,000% to 1,000,000%.\par \par \uc2 With information from AFP\par \par \uc2 MORE ON THIS THEME:\par \par \uc2 Juan Guaid\u243\'00\'F3\uc2  will travel to New York to speak at a side event to the \uc2 UN General Assembly\uc2  where Nicolas Maduro will be\par \par \uc2 Confessions of a Venezuelan military man on the border with Colombia: "I am verydisappointed in the Armed Forces"Iv\u225\'00\'E1n Duque ruled out a military \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite provocations: "Colombia does not assault anyone"\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020190906ef960014p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
