\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela Ctrl Bk Dir: $2B Earmarked To Defend  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Mai 2001\par 14:45\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  CARACAS -(Dow Jones)- Venezuela plans to sell up to $2 billion in the coming weeks to defend against speculative attacks on the bolivar ($1=VEB714.50), \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Director Domingo Maza said, according to a report Thursday on local television station Globovision's web site. \par \par \uc2  Maza said dollar demand is currently around $100 million a day, about 40% of which is fulfilled by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the remainder from the private sector. \par \par \uc2  Dollar outflows have increased in recent weeks after President Hugo Chavez said he may declare a state of emergency to better fight crime and corruption. \par \par \uc2  Also, although hotly denied by government officials, recent talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls to curb capital outflows have also added to investors' nervousness. \par \par \uc2  Pablo Medina, a leftist politician recently readmitted to Chavez's inner circle, said last week the government may impose a tax on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions. \par \par \uc2  The bolivar dropped a full VEB2.00 last week, its steepest weekly drop in months, trading as high as VEB717.00 before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Analysts have said \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2  can afford to defend the bolivar, given that its foreign reserves currently stand at about $20.02 billion, thanks to steadily high oil prices. \par \par \uc2  Oil accounts for about 80% of Venezuela's exports and around half of government income. \par \par \uc2  Globovision Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.globovision.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.globovision.com}}}\par \par \uc2  -By Jehan Senaratna, Dow Jones Newswires; 58212 564 1339; jehan.senaratna@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010711dx5v02gac\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
