\par\par \b \uc2  Venezuela bolivar ends off for fifth day running. \b0\par\par\uc2 197 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Juli 1998\par 22:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  CARACAS, July 28 (Reuters) - Venezuela's bolivar \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued a five-day slide to end marginally weaker at 561.50/562.50 per dollar Wednesday, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  meeting the vast majority of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  demand, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The exchange rate closed at 561.25/562.25 per dollar Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attended the market but without \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring down the exchange rate," said one trader. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Venezuela\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is unusual in that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is by far the largest foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  supplier, blurring the difference between \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and meeting real demand. \par \par \uc2  Traders said a large auction of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  monetary stabilisation, or TEM, bills Wednesday had further eased pressure on the bolivar \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Yields on the benchmark 28-day TEMs fell 153 basis points to 47.68 percent at Wednesday's auction but traders said the papers remained attractive given the current rate of bolivar depreciation. \par \par \uc2  "It's still more attractive to keep money in bolivars than dollars at those rates," one said. \par \par \uc2  ((-Yelitza Cova, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600, fax 582 861 3621, caracas.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par